# Quickstart on RDP

> Get started with Reed Protocol in minutes, building hybrid dApps that connect TON and EVM ecosystems

Get up and running with RDP development quickly by building your first hybrid dApp. This guide will take you from zero to a working application that connects TON wallets with EVM smart contracts in just a few minutes.

